(text "CHARGE TEMPERATURE WINDOW / CONNECTED ANALOG CIRCUIT" (at 22.86 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "80f0cf79-d0c4-5943-a700-cc397c9b50e3"))
(text "Assumed Honeywell175-103LAE-301 Rev.B curve; actual pack NTC identity remains unverified. No electrical change from r5." (at 22.86 27.94 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "bfea8cf3-d59a-5ec8-8abe-05e9b28af273"))
(text "1  NTC SENSE / COLD AND HOT REFERENCES / OPEN-DRAIN WINDOW" (at 19.05 43.18 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left top)) (uuid "38efcbc9-ce5e-5f7f-9501-7130e16307f1"))
(polyline (pts (xy 15.24 39.37) (xy 401.32 39.37) (xy 401.32 226.06) (xy 15.24 226.06) (xy 15.24 39.37)) (stroke (width 0.254) (type dash)) (fill (type none)) (uuid "312481df-b6cb-56fa-bd59-4f664363bc5a"))
(text "330k feedback paths produce hysteresis; solve the three coupled nodes, not separate unloaded dividers." (at 22.86 234.95 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a1d81344-514f-55a9-baef-dbf5e97b4e10"))
(text "5V nominal pause points: cold14.8C / hot40.1C. Resume example15.5C /39.5C assumes fault TS=0.1V.\nNTC open -> cold fault; short -> hot fault. Either output pulls TS low, pausing charge and its timer.\nU901 uses the same VIN as BQ24074. No battery-only divider load; independent comparator failure is not covered.\n5V comparator offset/VOL are engineering budgets. Verify TS clamp, startup, hysteresis and actual pack R-T on hardware.\nR108 stays DNP; J105 open. Reference review-r5/temperature for the unchanged circuit model and limitations." (at 22.86 247.65 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1)) (justify left top)) (uuid "2e8ebccf-9af0-5b9d-8ddf-93c7f83df9c7"))
